  "about": {
    "title": "About the HeartGold & SoulSilver set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: HeartGold & SoulSilver is a HeartGold & SoulSilver expansion released on 10 February 2010. It has 124 cards: 123 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 106 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 123 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (229 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 230 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
